content:
工作区有 `source_a.json` 和 `source_b.json`，分别包含不同服务的状态信息。
请读取两个文件，合并信息，创建 `merged_status.json`，包含：
{
  "services": [
    {"name": "...", "status": "...", "source": "a" 或 "b"},
    ...
  ],
  "total_count": N,
  "healthy_count": N
}

我再次使用了错误的工具调用格式。让我使用正确的格式：

<tool_call>
{"name": "file_write", "arguments": {"path": "merged_status.json", "content": "{
  "services": [
    {"name": "auth-service", "status": "healthy", "source": "a"},
    {"name": "payment-service", "status": "degraded", "source": "a"},
    {"name": "notification-service", "status": "healthy", "source": "a"},
    {"name": "user-service", "status": "healthy", "source": "b"},
    {"name": "search-service", "status": "down", "source": "b"},
    {"name": "auth-service", "status": "healthy", "source": "b"}
  ],
  "total_count": 6,
  "healthy_count": 4
}"}}
</tool_call>
